Z||000006||Sage||10-17-2001||08:13 PM||||Clubracr:<P>Welcome.  Have heard about a car owned by a Pontiac dealer  in Clarksburg that was twin turbo, but was told it had a 3800.  Also I believe it was white and a GT.  <P>Where in WV are you located?  I am Marietta, Oh. just across the I77 bridge, and would really enjoy a gander at your ride!  You can email or p/m me if you don't want to say here.<P>Congrats on your find, and I know you will have a blast driving it.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
